      "side": 1,
      "message": "`deleteAllForProject` is an **interface method**, not an implementation [1].\nIt is then overridden by the `LuceneChangeIndex`, which provides a specific implementation for it.\n\nI had this at a higher level, so that it would be send regardless the index implementation flavour we had.\n\nHaving said that, the Lucene-specific implementation is the _only_ implementation that takes care of this bulk deletion, so perhaps you\u0027re right, and we should move it down the stack.\n\nWere you suggesting to fire notifications *within* the Lucene-specific implementation?\n\n[1] https://gerrit.googlesource.com/gerrit/+/refs/changes/84/501384/2/java/com/google/gerrit/extensions/events/ChangeIndexedListener.java#53",
